Hello everyone,
I have a shape dataset for 2504 individuals classified in one of 243 species. So each species has more than one individual and the number of individuals per species is unequal. Do you know how to calculate mean shapes for each species? I know this is more a general R question than a geomorph, but I believe someone had experience with this.
Mihajlo

