Hi Mihajlo,

After performing your GPA using the "bilat.symmetry" or "gpagen" functions (be sure to provide a vector with species names), you can extract the results for each species as shown in the example below:

list_sp1<-GPA[,,species1]
list_sp2<-GPA[,,species2]

  Next, you can calculate the mean shape using the "mshape" function:

mshape(list_sp1)

I hope this helps.

Bests,

