Hi Mihajlo,

I am including a script for what you need to do:

Y1 <- mshape(gdf_rio$coords[,,which(gdf_rio$Sp == "Igeof")])

In this case, I calculated the mean shapes for the species “Igeof” … you can adapt this for your data, taking into account that gdf_rio was my data frame.

Hope this helps,

